# Default owner for everything in the repo.
* @TeamShryne

# Paths where a mistake is expensive, or where nothing else would catch it.
#
# .github/workflows/ — the build, release and emulator pipelines. A bad change
#   here can ship a broken APK, or quietly stop testing one.
# app/libs/ — the vendored mediyo-core AAR. Binary, and the only copy of the
#   Go core; a bad one is very hard to diagnose from the app's behaviour.
# app/proguard-rules.pro — decides what R8 may strip. A missing keep rule
#   breaks release builds only, and the debug tour will not catch it.
# app/build.gradle.kts — signing, versioning, ABI filters.
.github/workflows/ @TeamShryne
/app/libs/ @TeamShryne
/app/proguard-rules.pro @TeamShryne
/app/build.gradle.kts @TeamShryne
